gulations') as amended from time to time, we hereby inform you that the meeting of the Board of Directors of Lake Shore Realty Limited ('the Company') is scheduled to be held on Monday, 2nd November, 2026, inter-alia to transact the following businesses:\r\n\r\n1. To consider and approve the Standalone Unaudited Financial Results along with Limited Review report thereon for the quarter and half year ending 30th September, 2026.\r\n\r\n2. To consider and approve any other item(s) with the permission of the Chair.\r\n", "NEWSID": "101d2202-30b1-4058-ad31-715fb1fc201d", "NEWSSUB": "Board Meeting Intimation for Considering And Approving Un-Audited Standalone Financial Results Along With The Limited Review Reports Of Statutory Auditors Thereon For The Quarter And Half Year Ended 30Th September, 2026.", "NEWS_DT": "2026-10-29T13:54:54.21", "NSURL": "https://www.bseindia.com/stock-share-price/lake-shore-realty-ltd/lakeshore/519612/", "News_submission_dt": "2026-10-29T13:54:53", "OLD": 1, "PDFFLAG": 1, "QUARTER_ID": null, "RN": 1, "SCRIP_CD": 519612, "SLONGNAME": "Lake Shore Realty Ltd", "SUBCATNAME": "Board Meeting", "TimeDiff": "00:00:01", "XML_NAME": "ANN_519612_101D2202-30B1-4058-AD31-715FB1FC201D"}, {"AGENDA_ID": 1, "ANNOUNCEMENT_TYPE": "A", "ATTACHMENTNAME": "37ded6c4-110b-4095-84b7-d8675cb6aafa.pdf", "AUDIO_VIDEO_FILE": null, "BSENewsid": null, "CATEGORYNAME": "Company Update", "CRITICALNEWS": "0", "DT_TM": "2026-10-13T20:08:42.717", "DissemDT": "2026-10-13T20:08:42.717", "FILESTATUS": "N    ", "Fld_Attachsize": 5706289, "HEADLINE": "Company hereby submit revised financial result for the period ended 31.03.2026 along with audit report and declaration.", "Investor_Presentation": null, "MORE": "", "NEWSID": "a39f2939-10b2-42d9-be49-ff1f4f2e1751", "NEWSSUB": "With Reference To The Query Raised By BSE Vide Email Dated 12.10.2026 We Have Rectified The Discrepancy In The Financial Results For The Quarter And Year Ended 31.03.2026.", "NEWS_DT": "2026-10-13T20:08:42.717", "N